stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: plan created (schema + CEL already enforced)
    Pending --> Validating: reconcile pickup

    state Validating {
        [*] --> EvidenceHash
        EvidenceHash --> Citations
        Citations --> Scope
        Scope --> RiskScore
        RiskScore --> PolicyGate
        PolicyGate --> RBACFeasibility
        RBACFeasibility --> DryRun
    }

    Validating --> Rejected: any gate fails<br/>(EvidenceMismatch / CitationInvalid /<br/>ScopeViolation / PolicyDenied /<br/>RBACInfeasible / SimulationFailed / CircuitOpen)
    Validating --> AwaitingApproval: all gates pass (tier ≤ L2)
    Validating --> Executing: all gates pass (L3, under budget,<br/>measured history)

    AwaitingApproval --> Executing: approval hash matches boundTo
    AwaitingApproval --> Rejected: denied / 24h expiry /<br/>ApprovalInvalidated

    Executing --> Verifying: all actions applied,<br/>snapshots stored
    Executing --> RollingBack: apply failure after<br/>partial application
    Executing --> Failed: PreconditionDrift<br/>before any mutation

    Verifying --> Succeeded: predicate held for full window
    Verifying --> RollingBack: predicate failed,<br/>onFailure = Rollback
    Verifying --> Failed: predicate failed,<br/>onFailure = Escalate

    RollingBack --> RolledBack: restored + health re-check ok<br/>(breaker counter++)
    RollingBack --> Failed: RollbackUnsafe<br/>(third-party drift — never force)

    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    RolledBack --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
